{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hekaba is a puzzle/platformer game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzle:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Puzzles are at the heart of the game, based on an original pressure plate mechanic that is used to solve them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Platformer:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Exploration plays an essential role in solving the puzzles. To do so, you can move freely using elements of the environment that give you special abilities, such as double jumps or long leaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Immersive environment:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of the desert, an abandoned temple opens its doors to you. Its strange and captivating environments await your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)<strong><br><br><u>Game features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Run and jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Move from platform to platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve puzzles to advance in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839660?t=1756454110","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839660?t=1756454110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839660/b2edba7caaefec17a00e23f06c49c34e042b3d4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756454110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839660/b2edba7caaefec17a00e23f06c49c34e042b3d4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756454110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hekab